<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Twin Peaks - Bem-vindo aos Mistérios</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        :root {
            --twin-peaks-red: #dc2626;
            --twin-peaks-amber: #f59e0b;
            --dark-bg: #0a0a0a;
            --card-bg: #1a1a1a;
            --text-primary: #f5f5f5;
            --text-secondary: #a3a3a3;
            --border-color: #262626;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        .heading-font {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 1rem;
        }
        
        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.6), rgba(0,0,0,0.6)), 
                        url('https://www.twinpeaksblog.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/49_VacantPeaks_RedRoom_Part02_FloorMoving06.jpg') center/cover;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .hero-content h1 {
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
            animation: flicker 3s infinite alternate;
        }
        
        @keyframes flicker {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.8; }
        }
        
        .hero-content p {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            max-width: 600px;
        }
        
        .btn-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        
        .btn {
            padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        
        .btn-primary {
            background-color: var(--twin-peaks-red);
            color: white;
        }
        
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: #b91c1c;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.3);
        }
        
        .btn-outline {
            background-color: transparent;
            color: white;
            border: 2px solid white;
        }
        
        .btn-outline:hover {
            background-color: white;
            color: var(--dark-bg);
        }
        
        /* Sections */
        .section {
            padding: 5rem 0;
        }
        
        .section-title {
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }
        
        .section-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 4rem;
        }
        
        /* About Section */
        .about-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 3rem;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .about-image {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }
        
        .about-content h3 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--twin-peaks-red);
        }
        
        .about-content p {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
        
        /* Characters Section */
        .characters {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
        }
        
        .cards-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }
        
        .card {
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.2);
        }
        
        .card-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }
        
        .card-content {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }
        
        .card-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .card-subtitle {
            color: var(--twin-peaks-amber);
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .card-text {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        
        /* Atmosphere Section */
        .atmosphere-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 3rem;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .features-list {
            list-style: none;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
        
        .features-list li {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
        
        .bullet {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            background-color: var(--twin-peaks-red);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        
        /* CTA Section */
        .cta {
            background-color: var(--twin-peaks-red);
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .cta h2 {
            color: white;
        }
        
        .cta p {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .btn-secondary {
            background-color: var(--twin-peaks-amber);
            color: var(--dark-bg);
        }
        
        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background-color: #d97706;
        }
        
        .btn-outline-light {
            background-color: transparent;
            color: white;
            border: 2px solid white;
        }
        
        .btn-outline-light:hover {
            background-color: white;
            color: var(--twin-peaks-red);
        }
        
        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 3rem 0 1rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }
        
        .footer-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .footer-section h3,
        .footer-section h4 {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--twin-peaks-red);
        }
        
        .footer-section ul {
            list-style: none;
        }
        
        .footer-section ul li {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .footer-section a {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .footer-section a:hover {
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }
        
        .footer-bottom {
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }
        
        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .about-grid,
            .atmosphere-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 2rem;
            }
            
            .btn-group {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }
            
            .btn {
                width: 200px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1 class="heading-font">Twin Peaks</h1>
            <p>Bem-vindo aos mistérios da pequena cidade onde nada é o que parece</p>
            <div class="btn-group">
                <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Explorar Mistérios</a>
                <%= link_to "Personagens", new_character_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About Section -->
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title heading-font">Uma Série Cult Inesquecível</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">
                Twin Peaks é uma obra-prima que revolucionou a televisão, misturando mistério, drama e elementos sobrenaturais de forma única.
            </p>
            
            <div class="about-grid">
                <div>
                    <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/a9/Twinpeaksonearmedgiant.jpg" 
                         alt="Red Room de Twin Peaks" class="about-image">
                </div>
                <div class="about-content">
                    <h3 class="heading-font">O Mistério de Laura Palmer</h3>
                    <p>
                        Quando a popular estudante Laura Palmer é encontrada morta, o agente especial Dale Cooper chega à pequena cidade de Twin Peaks para investigar. O que ele descobre vai muito além de um simples assassinato.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Criada por David Lynch e Mark Frost, a série explora os segredos obscuros de uma comunidade aparentemente pacífica, revelando um mundo onde o sobrenatural e o cotidiano se entrelaçam de forma perturbadora.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Characters Section -->
    <section class="section characters">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title heading-font">Personagens Inesquecíveis</h2>
            
            <div class="cards-grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <img src="https://twinpeaksblog.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/22_TPB_Prop_RoadhouseReturnHunt_2009CooperThumbsUpLightning.jpg" 
                         alt="Agente Dale Cooper" class="card-image">
                    <div class="card-content">
                        <h3 class="card-title heading-font">Agente Dale Cooper</h3>
                        <p class="card-subtitle">FBI Special Agent</p>
                        <p class="card-text">
                            O excêntrico agente do FBI que chega a Twin Peaks para investigar o assassinato de Laura Palmer. Conhecido por seu amor por café e torta de cereja.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="card">
                    <img src="https://twinpeaksblog.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/TPB_Prop_LauraHomeUniversityBook_05_DonnaLauraOutsideSchool.jpg" 
                         alt="Laura Palmer" class="card-image">
                    <div class="card-content">
                        <h3 class="card-title heading-font">Laura Palmer</h3>
                        <p class="card-subtitle">A Rainha do Baile</p>
                        <p class="card-text">
                            A popular estudante cujo assassinato desencadeia os eventos da série. Seus segredos obscuros são gradualmente revelados ao longo da investigação.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="card">
                    <img src="https://welcometotwinpeaks.com/wp-content/uploads/harry-truman-michael-ontkean-jacket-785x555.jpg" 
                         alt="Sheriff Truman" class="card-image">
                    <div class="card-content">
                        <h3 class="card-title heading-font">Sheriff Truman</h3>
                        <p class="card-subtitle">Xerife Local</p>
                        <p class="card-text">
                            O dedicado xerife de Twin Peaks que se torna parceiro e amigo do Agente Cooper na investigação dos mistérios da cidade.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Atmosphere Section -->
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="atmosphere-grid">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="heading-font" style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Atmosfera Única</h2>
                    <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                        A série é famosa por sua atmosfera onírica e perturbadora, criada através da direção visionária de David Lynch e da trilha sonora hipnotizante de Angelo Badalamenti.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="features-list">
                        <li><span class="bullet"></span>Direção cinematográfica inovadora</li>
                        <li><span class="bullet"></span>Trilha sonora icônica</li>
                        <li><span class="bullet"></span>Elementos sobrenaturais únicos</li>
                        <li><span class="bullet"></span>Personagens memoráveis</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <img src="https://i0.wp.com/www.thewrap.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/twin-peaks-revival-bang-bang-bar-roadhouse-richard-horne-eamon-farren.jpg?fit=618%2C412&quality=89&ssl=1" 
                         alt="Double R Diner" class="about-image">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section class="section cta">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title heading-font">Entre no Mundo de Twin Peaks</h2>
            <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 2rem;">
                Junte-se à comunidade de fãs e descubra todos os segredos desta série revolucionária
            </p>
            <div class="btn-group">
                <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">Cadastrar-se</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
</body>
</html>